# OSP Designer I

## Job Description

We are seeking a skilled OSP Designer I to join our team.

### Responsibilities

* Produce OSP design packages for fiber optic and copper network construction projects, including permit packages, make-ready packages, and as-built documentation.
* Conduct field investigations and surveys to gather data for design purposes.
* Develop OSP design drawings and maps using GIS tools and AutoCAD.
* Collaborate with engineering and construction teams to ensure accurate designs.
* Maintain project records and documentation.

### Requirements

* Proficiency in GIS tools (e.g., ArcGIS, QGIS) and AutoCAD.
* Knowledge of fiber optic network design principles.
* Strong attention to detail and ability to manage multiple projects.

### Benefits

* Competitive pay
* Health, dental, and vision insurance
* 401(k) with company match
* Paid time off
* Ongoing training and development

